			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance submodules — Documentation cleanup and logging refactor\n\nUpdate three element submodules to synchronize documentation with current architecture and improve logging readability:\n\n**Air** (docs): Remove deprecated `Mountain/` directory entry from README after its removal from Air's public API exports. Documentation now reflects the current codebase state.\n\n**Vine** (docs): Simplify the Mermaid architecture diagram in README.md by removing internal implementation details (Mountain crates, generated bindings) and the planned Grove WASM host node. The diagram now shows only the production gRPC topology: VineServer ↔ GRPCClient representing the live Mountain ↔ Cocoon communication path.\n\n**Wind** (style): Add consistent whitespace and spacing across logging and telemetry modules (Trace.ts, PostHogBridge.ts, Sandbox.ts, Tier.ts, WorkbenchIntegrationImplementation.ts) for improved readability. Enhance error handling and performance measurement in Trace.ts, and streamline state updates in WorkbenchIntegrationImplementation.ts.\n\nAll changes are cosmetic or documentation updates with no functional behavior changes.",
